      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_04",
      "hash64": "FAD62753CBFFD1FB",
      "text": "아, 부원~! 입부 희망자시군요!\\n휴~ 깜짝 놀라라!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_05",
      "hash64": "FAD62653CBFFD048",
      "text": "음~ 입부하시는 거는\\n전혀 문제없어요. 근데...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_04",
